# Instructions for Google Play Store Release Keystore:
# 1. Run the following command in terminal to generate your upload keystore:
#    keytool -genkey -v -keystore android/app/zhospar-upload-key.jks -keyalg RSA -keysize 2048 -validity 10000 -alias zhospar
# 2. Copy this file as `android/key.properties` and fill in your passwords:
#
# storePassword=your_keystore_password
# keyPassword=your_key_password
# keyAlias=zhospar
# storeFile=zhospar-upload-key.jks
